      <strong>Time controls shape how games end more than how long they last.</strong> Classical games have the highest resignation rate (61.8%) and draw rate (7.8%), while Bullet has the highest timeout rate (15.3%). Surprisingly, Classical games are shorter in moves (54.2 avg turns) than Rapid (61.1) due to earlier recognition of lost positions.
